<br />
Nah, one thing is using the [AI] tag for games that were made using AI directly. 
<br />

<br />
On the other hand using the [AI] tag for a game completely made by hand that just happens to use a tool that happens to be made using AI would be misleading.    <script type="text/javascript">      
<!--
        document.write('</div>');      
//-->
    </script>  </div></blockquote>
<br />

<br />
Toxa (I think) is saying this thread title should have the AI tag because the language/compiler was made with AI. He's right, and that makes sense if AI ports have to be tagged AI too.
<br />

<br />
Then people afterward seem to have misinterpreted that as games made with this compiler should also be tagged AI, but that's not what he was saying.</span><br />
